          ],
          "retained": [
            "Changed both multiply overloads from i-j-k dot products to i-k-j row streaming, accessing each RHS row and output row contiguously.",
            "Blocked the k loop into batches of 16 and reduced each output row modulo mod after each batch; skipped inner-row work when the left factor is zero."
          ]
