        "hypothesis": "Exponentiating x^(H-1) modulo the recurrence polynomial and combining the resulting coefficients with the initial terms preserves every valid NPbonacci result while avoiding repeated dense matrix multiplication.",
        "id": "142fe33b0b5648e6",
        "ordinal": 2,
        "parent_id": null,
        "role": "G",
        "source_commits": [
